$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Preparation of
2-((4R,6S)-6-((E)-2-(4-(4-fluorophenyl)-6-isopropy2-(N-methysulfonamido)pyrimidin-5-yl)vinyl)-2,2-dimethy1,3-dioxan-4-yl)acetate,
methyl ester
N-(4-(4-flurophenl)-5-formy6-isopropylpyrimidin-2-yl)-N-methylmethanesulfonamide
(1.0 g, 2.9 mmol) and
2-((4R,6S)-6-((1-methylH-tetrazo5-ylsulfonyl)methyl)-2,2-
dimethyl,3-dioxan-4-yl)acetate methyl ester (0.79g, 2.3mmol) were added
to tetrahydrofuran (10 mL). The mixture was heated until all reactants
were dissolved and then cooled to -60°C. At this temperature 3.3 mL of a
NaHMDS solution (1 M in tetrahydrofuran, total 3.3 mmol) was added in l h
while keeping the temperature between -50 and -60°C. When dosing was
completed, the temperature was allowed to increase to -10°C after which
the reaction was quenched with 10% aqueous NH4Cl (10 mL). The phases were
separated and the organic phase was washed successively with 10% aqueous
NH4Cl (1 x 10 ml) and 10% aqueous Na2CO3 (3 x 10 mL). The organic phase
was evaporated to give the title compound. Solid, yield (0.58 g, 1.1
mmol, 48% ). 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) 6 7.66 (dd, 2H), 7.09 (t, 2H), 6.53
(d, 1H), 5.49 (dd, 1H), 4.42-4.21 (m, 2H), 3.72 (s, 3H), 3.58 (s, 3H),
3.52 (s, 3H), 3.49-3.32 (m, 1H), 2.54 (ddd, 2H), 1.59-1.43 (m, 2H), 1.50
(s, 3H), 1.41 (s, 3H), 1.28, (dd, 6H).
